### 0 cli render calc.wtf --format text
$ wtf render calc.wtf --format text --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00
exit 0
--- stdout
[$10]:unit
[3]:qty
[groceries] := table = 3 rows · 2 columns
| item  | price        |
| ----- | ------------ |
| apple | $3.30        |
| bulk  | [unit * qty] $30 |
| one   | [unit] $10       |
[total] := sum(groceries, price) = $43.30

